cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or build on this work, please cite the paper below."
title: "Multi-cell VLC Testbed"
abstract: >-
  Software-defined visible light communication testbed built on GNU Radio and
  USRP hardware, evaluating zero-forcing precoding and joint transmission for
  inter-cell interference in a two-cell VLC system with phosphor-converted
  white LEDs and black-silicon photodetectors.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/REPLACE-ME/multicell-vlc-testbed"
keywords:
  - visible light communication
  - VLC
  - LiFi
  - optical wireless
  - GNU Radio
  - USRP
  - software-defined radio
  - OFDM
  - MIMO
  - zero-forcing precoding
  - joint transmission
  - coordinated multi-point
